\begin_inset Formula $\epsl:=\eps^{(k)}$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $\epss:=\eps^{(k+1)}$
\end_inset

, then all circles in 
\begin_inset Formula $\OPT$
\end_inset

 with radii 
\begin_inset Formula $\epss\leq r_{i}\epsl$
\end_inset

 have a total profit of at most 
\begin_inset Formula $\eps\cdot w(\OPT)$
\end_inset

.
 
